// title: Internet facing devices vulnerablility report
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceInfo, DeviceTvmSoftwareVulnerabilities
// purpose: Internet facing devices vulnerablility report
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/Internet%20facing%20devices%20vulnerablility%20report.kql
